<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for Thursday was estimated at $9.48 per cwt live, down 0.07 when compared to Wednesday's value.  - USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S., TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT VALUE</p>
<p>(STEER) -			  Lbs    Price  Change    Value</p>
<p>Steer hide, butt brand	 5.39   84.00   -0.50    5.80</p>
<p>Tallow, edible		   1.20   24.75   -0.50    0.30</p>
<p>Tallow, packer bleachable    4.50   21.75   -0.50    0.98</p>
<p>Tongues, Swiss #1 Wht 0-3%   0.26  200.00    -	 0.52</p>
<p>Cheek meat, trmd		 0.32   64.00    0.75    0.20</p>
<p>Head meat			  0.13   45.50    -	 0.06</p>
<p>Oxtail, selected		 0.16  131.00    -	 0.21</p>
<p>Hearts, reg, bone out	  0.38   25.25    0.25    0.10</p>
<p>Lips, unscalded		  0.11   72.00    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Livers, slcted, gall off     0.96   35.00    -	 0.34</p>
<p>Tripe, scalded edible	  0.65   20.00    -	 0.13</p>
<p>Tripe, honeycomb bleached    0.15   50.00    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Lungs, inedible		  0.47    4.60    -	 0.02</p>
<p>Melts				0.14    6.25    -	 0.01</p>
<p>Meat bone ml, 50% blk/ton    3.70  260.00   -4.50    0.48</p>
<p>Blood meal, 85% blk/ton	0.60  555.00  -15.00    0.17</p>
<p>TOTAL :			   19.12			  9.48</p>
<p>The average value of hide and offal for the four days ending Thursday, January 23, 1997 was estimated at 9.56 per cwt., down -0.09 from last week and up 1.42 from last year.</p>
